            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nIn this text, we will practice the subtraction operation. Before starting, we suggest studying the texts from Chapter 3 of the *First Steps* section of **History Tracers** (<htcite0>).",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "b5efc8f9-c268-430f-9681-7a43848ee48e",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
